<title>USA: Sonat marketing opens Pittsburgh office.</title>
<headline>Sonat marketing opens Pittsburgh office.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonat Marketing Co, a subsidiary of Sonat Inc, said Wednesday it has opened its Northeast Regional Office in Pittsburgh.</p>
<p>It said John Hormell, account manager for the northeast region, is responsible for developing business in Pittsburgh and surrounding areas including Ohio, western Pennsylvania and West Virginia.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
